# Model artifacts, regenerated by `python train.py`.
#
# Deliberately not committed. The bundle is a joblib pickle whose contents are
# bound to exact library versions, so tracking it would recreate exactly the
# class of problem Issue #4/#2 documented: a model artifact in the repo that
# silently disagrees with the code that produced it. A fresh clone plus
# `python train.py` rebuilds it bit-for-bit.
artifacts/
artifacts_*/

